{
  "file" : "npc/quests/quests_geffen.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've never heard of me? Why, I'm the Veteran Blacksmith of this land. I've spent 30 years in this hot and bloody hellfire, bending steel to my iron will!",
      "translation" : "沒聽說過我？我可是這片土地上資歷最深的鐵匠。在這灼熱又殘酷的爐火旁，我已度過三十年，憑著鋼鐵般的意志鍛造鋼材！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But...",
      "translation" : "不過..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am growing older and my prowess begins to fade with age. So I've invented something for young, hot, upcoming Blacksmiths, in hopes that they too will master my craft...",
      "translation" : "我漸漸老了，手藝也開始隨著年紀退步。於是我發明了一件東西，送給年輕有為的新晉鐵匠，希望他們也能掌握我的技藝..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What is it?",
      "translation" : "是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We Blacksmiths must always manipulate steel under extreme heat, and the hot air and melted metals are more than most people can stand.",
      "translation" : "我們鐵匠總得在高溫下鍛鋼。灼熱的空氣和熔化的金屬，可不是一般人受得了的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For the sake of our craft, our beautiful, yet masculine faces are put at risk...",
      "translation" : "為了這門手藝，我們英俊又陽剛的臉龐總是面臨危險..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But with this wonder of technology, there's no need to worry! Behold, the ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 !!",
      "translation" : "有了這項了不起的發明，就不用擔心了！看啊，^3355FF焊接面罩^000000!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It works by covering your face with a fat metal plate. Truly, it's an item that everyone should want! If not yourself, it'd be a good idea to give this to a friend who is studying smithing.",
      "translation" : "它用一塊厚實的金屬板遮住臉。真是人人都該擁有的好東西！自己不用的話，送給正在學習鍛造的朋友也不錯。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So how about it ? If you give me ^2244FF50 Steel^000000 and ^4422FFonly 2000 Zeny^000000, I will make it for you right away~!!",
      "translation" : "怎麼樣？給我^2244FF50個鋼鐵^000000和^4422FF區區2000 Zeny^000000，我馬上就替你做好~!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm... Not bad. Alright.",
      "translation" : "嗯...還不錯。好吧"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How does it work again?",
      "translation" : "它是怎麼用的來著？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I see that you appreciate a Blacksmith's work! Alright, I'll do it right away !!",
      "translation" : "啊，看來你很欣賞鐵匠的手藝！好，我這就開工!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahaha~! Make good use of that!",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈~!好好使用它吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You do not have the items I require.",
      "translation" : "你沒有帶齊我需要的物品。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A common Blacksmith would interpret this as a sign of disrepect, but I will forgive you. Just don't forget what I need if you want me to make you this mask.",
      "translation" : "一般的鐵匠會把這當成侮辱，不過我就原諒你吧。想讓我替你製作面罩的話，可別忘了我需要的材料。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 protects your face by covering it with a fat metal plate. This invention is the result of 30 years of endless toil at the hammer and anvil.",
      "translation" : "^3355FF焊接面罩^000000用厚實的金屬板保護你的臉。這項發明是我三十年來在鐵砧旁不懈勞作的成果。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[鐵匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah...!",
      "translation" : "啊...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess this is the first time you've met a Blacksmith as great as me, and you're just speechless with awe. Please, take your time and speak up when you are ready.",
      "translation" : "看來你還是第一次遇到我這麼了不起的鐵匠，已經敬佩得說不出話了。彆著急，準備好了再開口吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFThis guy seems",
      "translation" : "^3355FF這傢伙看起來"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a little full",
      "translation" : "有點"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of himself.^000000",
      "translation" : "太自戀了。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please listen",
      "translation" : "請聽聽"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "to my story",
      "translation" : "我的故事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of my blessed",
      "translation" : "關於我敬愛的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "grandfather.",
      "translation" : "祖父。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk",
      "translation" : "談談"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask about Items needed",
      "translation" : "詢問所需材料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Manufacture",
      "translation" : "製造"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Quit",
      "translation" : "退出"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My Grandfather, who passed away a few years ago, was special to me. He always stayed with me, and took care of me. He was much better than my old man, who was always busy working.",
      "translation" : "幾年前去世的祖父對我來說非常特別。他總是陪伴並照顧我，比整天忙著工作的父親好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "To me, Grandfather's library was always like a fantasy land where I could escape. I spent most of my time there.",
      "translation" : "對我而言，祖父的圖書館就像一個可以逃避現實的幻想世界。我大部分時間都待在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I learned a lot of things from his books in the Library. Grandfather was interested in Alchemy and Music, and his Library was filled with many mysterious old books.",
      "translation" : "我從圖書館裡的藏書學到了很多。祖父對鍊金術和音樂很感興趣，圖書館裡堆滿了許多神秘的古書。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "One day...",
      "translation" : "有一天..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As usual, I went to the Library and discovered an interesting schematic.",
      "translation" : "我像往常一樣去了圖書館，發現了一張有趣的設計圖。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It showed some instrument which looked like Ear Muffs that, when worn on the head, could transmit music or whispers to the ears through a thin wire.",
      "translation" : "圖紙上畫著一種像耳罩的裝置，戴在頭上後，就能通過細線把音樂或低語傳到耳邊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess...",
      "translation" : "我想..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is my grand father's unfinished work. I met a few Alchemists and asked them to produce it, but they rejected my offer...",
      "translation" : "那是祖父未完成的作品。我找過幾位鍊金術士，請他們幫忙製作，可他們都拒絕了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In the end, I thought 'I've gotta make it myself.' So I researched for a few years, and now I fully understand how to make that thing. But, I could never gather the materials to make it!",
      "translation" : "最後我想，'乾脆自己來做！'於是研究了幾年，現在我已經完全弄懂了製作方法。可是，我一直湊不齊材料！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If I can get those articles, I would build it right away. If you are interested in my idea, would you bring them for me?",
      "translation" : "只要拿到那些材料，我馬上就能把它做出來。你要是對我的想法感興趣，可以幫我把材料帶來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "All I wanna do is build this thing in honor of my grandfather and finish the work he started. If you ask me to keep it, I wouldn't mind.",
      "translation" : "我只想為了紀念祖父，完成他開始的工作。你若願意讓我留下成品，我也不會介意。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "40 ^3355FFSteel^000000",
      "translation" : "40個^3355FF鋼鐵^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFOridecon^000000",
      "translation" : "1個^3355FF神之金屬^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFAlcohol^000000",
      "translation" : "1個^3355FF酒精^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFCoal^000000",
      "translation" : "1個^3355FF煤礦^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "These are the things I need for Grandfather's masterpiece.",
      "translation" : "這些就是完成祖父傑作所需的材料。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Tap! Tap! Tap!*",
      "translation" : "*嗒！嗒！嗒！*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you.",
      "translation" : "謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Because of you, I could accomplish my grandfather's wish. He would be happy if he looked down on me from Heaven.",
      "translation" : "多虧了你，我才能實現祖父的願望。如果他能從天上看著我，一定會很高興。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As I said, please take this. I am just proud that I can make this by myself.",
      "translation" : "我說過了，這個請收下。我只是為能親手做出它而感到自豪。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for trying to help me, but you didn't bring all the items I need. I think you will find them all soon though.",
      "translation" : "謝謝你願意幫我，不過你帶來的材料還不齊。我想你很快就能找齊的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃裡克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "N-no?",
      "translation" : "不、不嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well...",
      "translation" : "這樣啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Eric",
